05:12:19.372 --> 05:12:24.692
out how to bend space-time and discover
some wormholes or, or something.

05:12:24.872 --> 05:12:25.792
- Once we do, do you think,

05:12:26.992 --> 05:12:31.872
you think all humans on Earth will
die once or twice and be repopulated

05:12:33.072 --> 05:12:34.652
After we get a good backup going?

05:12:35.792 --> 05:12:39.692
- I mean, that was actually one of my
