05:12:39.752 --> 05:12:43.512
one where they get uploaded
to the 1980s sea town

05:12:43.572 --> 05:12:47.472
somewhere. And I just
thought like, wow, this is

05:12:47.512 --> 05:12:50.512
both such a dark moment, yet also so

05:12:50.572 --> 05:12:54.412
beautiful in the shared recognition that,
