05:12:55.652 --> 05:12:59.572
Like, I don't have a lot of
nostalgia for many moments, but I do

05:12:59.612 --> 05:13:00.852
have nostalgia for the '80s.

05:13:00.972 --> 05:13:00.982
- But-

05:13:01.712 --> 05:13:05.392
- And they say something about, like, whatever
place and time you were in, the music you were

05:13:05.432 --> 05:13:07.572
listening to when you were 12 or-

05:13:07.612 --> 05:13:11.372
... or 14, 15, something like that, that's
what's gonna stick with you. Like, no, I was

05:13:11.452 --> 05:13:16.952
only, I got to be 10 in the '80s. So
this was my early childhood, and I

05:13:17.012 --> 05:13:20.942
still have an unbelievably
fond affiliation with

05:13:20.942 --> 05:13:23.632
