05:13:24.712 --> 05:13:25.452
- ... I'm doing the '80s.

05:13:26.212 --> 05:13:28.812
- Wow. I don't think I've actually
ever heard anyone say that.

05:13:29.912 --> 05:13:31.592
Usually it's '70s or '90s.

05:13:31.732 --> 05:13:31.962
- Oh, and the-

05:13:31.962 --> 05:13:32.872
- Because the '80s is a-

05:13:32.912 --> 05:13:37.992
- I really don't like the '90s.
Can we talk about this?

05:13:38.332 --> 05:13:40.452
- No, I'm done. Not done.

05:13:40.752 --> 05:13:45.272
- To me, this was the great
turning point of nihilism.

05:13:45.352 --> 05:13:50.252
That both the music,
the genre, the fashion-

05:13:50.412 --> 05:13:53.952
... everything turned from,
like, this glamour, the

05:13:54.012 --> 05:14:00.712
