05:14:05.702 --> 05:14:08.032
... the morals. I don't like
any of the underpinnings to it.

05:14:08.052 --> 05:14:11.232
There was just such a defeatism to it-

05:14:11.242 --> 05:14:14.932
... that in retrospect, I look back
upon it, if I'm gonna get reinserted

05:14:15.012 --> 05:14:17.132
