05:14:17.812 --> 05:14:20.592
- That was full of optimism and fun-

05:14:20.792 --> 05:14:21.092
- Yes

05:14:21.102 --> 05:14:22.052
- ... and colors.

05:14:22.232 --> 05:14:29.092
- Yes. I remember having these orange pants-

05:14:29.172 --> 05:14:33.112
