them. That was just a normal

05:14:33.192 --> 05:14:35.352
thing kids could wear in the '80s.

05:14:35.572 --> 05:14:42.412
I've never fucking seen that today. Or I
mean, even in the '90s, it all turned just,

05:14:42.472 --> 05:14:46.372
