05:14:46.452 --> 05:14:50.112
- So the Nietzschean, you know,
this idea of eternal recurrence.

05:14:50.572 --> 05:14:54.512
If you do a Groundhog Day and you live
forever, you want it to be in the orange pants

05:14:54.572 --> 05:14:56.082
with the white dots in the '80s.

05:14:56.172 --> 05:14:57.452
- Maybe I'm gonna skip
the orange pants, but-

05:14:57.552 --> 05:14:57.572
- No

05:14:57.752 --> 05:14:58.802
- ... I'm definitely picking the '80s.

05:14:58.892 --> 05:14:59.452
- You said it.

